      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHARAPOVA STAR (8) has been in super consistent form recently with three minors on end before breaking through for an overdue win (21.97) at Shepparton. Form at this distance is sound. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. LILLY ZOOM (1) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (19.48) over 350m at Healesville. Has a win and three minor placings from four starts from this draw. Winning chance. REVITALISE (2) missed the frame last time at Horsham but just three runs back flew around 390m at this track in 22.21. Should be in this for a long way. SKETCHY DEMOS (6) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
